# The gate. A badge opens the cave, and this is what makes the gym worth
# walking into: the guard stands on the one tile the warp can be reached
# from, so there is nothing to squeeze past.
npc gateguard 11 1 south villager
  hideif badge_stone
  say The cave is shut. GYM BADGES ONLY.
  say GRANITA holds the one you want.
end

